   "roundness": null,
   "text": "slainte usage: ZERO ('i never use it... im not prompted and\nforget' - Tony, interviewed). its .slainte target list still\naudits a CHANGELOG dead since 0.14.0. meanwhile five goal\ngates produced five layer-4 blocks - every one a stale-\nnarrative gap found AFTER shipping. CI refuses the mechanical\nlayer; nothing sweeps the story.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "slainte usage: ZERO ('i never use it... im not prompted and\nforget' - Tony, interviewed). its .slainte target list still\naudits a CHANGELOG dead since 0.14.0. meanwhile five goal\ngates produced five layer-4 blocks - every one a stale-\nnarrative gap found AFTER shipping. CI refuses the mechanical\nlayer; nothing sweeps the story.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
