   "roundness": null,
   "text": "slainte SKILL.md RE-FOUNDED (6): identity, config section\ndeleted, release-pass charter, pruned rules, derived targets.\ntend (5): .slainte leaves required-files/scaffold/report,\njoins the deprecated-patterns list with offered deletion.\nconductor (2): orient bare-repo wire; close-out release wire\nas step 6, boundary renumbers 6->7, marker stays last.\nstate-contract (2 rows) - playbook (1) - README (slainte\nsection + What's New v0.85.0 cap-five) - kerd-map one-liner +\nregen - git rm .slainte - version 0.85.0 (3 fields).",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "slainte SKILL.md RE-FOUNDED (6): identity, config section\ndeleted, release-pass charter, pruned rules, derived targets.\ntend (5): .slainte leaves required-files/scaffold/report,\njoins the deprecated-patterns list with offered deletion.\nconductor (2): orient bare-repo wire; close-out release wire\nas step 6, boundary renumbers 6->7, marker stays last.\nstate-contract (2 rows) - playbook (1) - README (slainte\nsection + What's New v0.85.0 cap-five) - kerd-map one-liner +\nregen - git rm .slainte - version 0.85.0 (3 fields).",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
