   "text": "honest limit, NAMED: the\ntrigger is prompt-layer -\na skipped pass is today's\nstatus quo; CI graduation\nsits behind the accepted\nrisk's review trigger.\nrigor mvp: measured =\ngreps/diffs; waived-by-name\n= first triggered pass at\nthe next real release.",
