   "roundness": null,
   "text": "EXTERNAL/DECLARED SURFACES (websites, SDK docs, portals,\nmarketplace beyond this repo): slice 2, own mechanism.\nCI GRADUATION (What's-New-untouched refusal): review trigger.\nKIVNA SCAFFOLD VERDICT: Backlog archaeology, untouched.\nSKRIV SKILL.md: untouched - called, not changed.\nSWITCH: untouched entirely - the pass runs before the\nboundary; the boundary contract stays v0.84.0's.",
